        "## Practice 2: Software Bill of Materials (SBOM)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Maintain a machine‑readable inventory of all components:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Format: CycloneDX 1.4  \n",
        "- Includes: name, version, purl, license, hashes  \n",
        "- Enables: fast CVE impact analysis, compliance, and audits  \n",
        "\n",
        "This mirrors what you’d do in a real ML platform to support vulnerability management and regulatory requirements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "print(\"\\n\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
        "print(\"PRACTICE 2: SOFTWARE BILL OF MATERIALS (SBOM)\")\n",
        "print(\"=\"*70)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nWhat is an SBOM?\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Complete inventory of all software components\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Includes versions, licenses, hashes, suppliers\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Machine-readable format (CycloneDX, SPDX)\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Required for vulnerability management at scale\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n[Generating SBOM]\")\n",
        "print(\"Command: cyclonedx-py -r -i requirements.lock -o sbom.json\")\n",
        "print(\"Note: Install with: pip install cyclonedx-bom\")\n",
        "\n",
        "sbom = {\n",
        "    \"bomFormat\": \"CycloneDX\",\n",
        "    \"specVersion\": \"1.4\",\n",
        "    \"version\": 1,\n",
        "    \"metadata\": {\n",
        "        \"timestamp\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n",
        "        \"component\": {\n",
        "            \"type\": \"application\",\n",
        "            \"name\": \"ml-training-pipeline\",\n",
        "            \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"components\": [\n",
        "        {\n",
        "            \"type\": \"library\",\n",
        "            \"name\": \"numpy\",\n",
        "            \"version\": \"1.24.3\",\n",
        "            \"purl\": \"pkg:pypi/numpy@1.24.3\",\n",
        "            \"licenses\": [{\"license\": {\"id\": \"BSD-3-Clause\"}}],\n",
        "            \"hashes\": [{\"alg\": \"SHA-256\", \"content\": \"ab344f1bf21f140adab...\"}]\n",
        "        },\n",
        "        {\n",
        "            \"type\": \"library\",\n",
        "            \"name\": \"torch\",\n",
        "            \"version\": \"2.0.1\",\n",
        "            \"purl\": \"pkg:pypi/torch@2.0.1\",\n",
        "            \"licenses\": [{\"license\": {\"id\": \"BSD-3-Clause\"}}],\n",
        "            \"hashes\": [{\"alg\": \"SHA-256\", \"content\": \"f4c7b2f7e8d9a1b2c3d...\"}]\n",
        "        },\n",
        "        {\n",
        "            \"type\": \"library\",\n",
        "            \"name\": \"scikit-learn\",\n",
        "            \"version\": \"1.3.0\",\n",
        "            \"purl\": \"pkg:pypi/scikit-learn@1.3.0\",\n",
        "            \"licenses\": [{\"license\": {\"id\": \"BSD-3-Clause\"}}],\n",
        "            \"hashes\": [{\"alg\": \"SHA-256\", \"content\": \"9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0...\"}]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "with open('sbom.json', 'w') as f:\n",
        "    json.dump(sbom, f, indent=2)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"✓ Generated sbom.json (CycloneDX format)\")\n",
        "print(\"\\n[SBOM Contents (truncated)]\")\n",
        "print(json.dumps(sbom, indent=2)[:500] + \"...\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n[Using SBOMs for Vulnerability Management]\")\n",
        "print(\"\\n1. Store SBOMs in central repository\")\n",
        "print(\"   • One SBOM per ML system/model\")\n",
        "print(\"   • Track SBOM versions over time\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n2. Query SBOMs when CVE announced\")\n",
        "print(\"   Example: CVE-2024-12345 affects numpy 1.24.0-1.24.3\")\n",
        "print(\"   Query: Which systems use vulnerable numpy versions?\")\n",
        "print(\"   Result: ml-training-pipeline, model-api-v2, etc.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n3. Automated vulnerability tracking\")\n",
        "print(\"   • Daily scan all SBOMs against CVE databases\")\n",
        "print(\"   • Alert teams when their systems are affected\")\n",
        "print(\"   • Track remediation progress\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n✅ Benefits:\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Instant vulnerability impact analysis\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Compliance and audit requirements\")\n",
        "print(\"  • License compliance tracking\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Dependency transparency\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
