        "## Practice 4: Automated Security Gates in CI/CD\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Enforce security automatically on every PR:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Run `pip-audit` and `Safety`  \n",
        "- Enforce license policy via `pip-licenses`  \n",
        "- Check against approved dependency list  \n",
        "- Require SBOM generation  \n",
        "\n",
        "Configuration is stored in `security_gate_config.json` and used by CI/CD pipelines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "print(\"\\n\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
        "print(\"PRACTICE 4: AUTOMATED SECURITY GATES IN CI/CD\")\n",
        "print(\"=\"*70)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nWhat are Security Gates?\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Automated checks in CI/CD pipeline\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Block builds with security violations\")\n",
        "print(\"  • No human intervention needed\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Enforcement, not just detection\")\n",
        "\n",
        "security_gate_config = {\n",
        "    \"vulnerability_scanning\": {\n",
        "        \"tools\": [\"pip-audit\", \"safety\"],\n",
        "        \"fail_on\": [\"CRITICAL\", \"HIGH\"],\n",
        "        \"allow_exceptions\": False\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"license_scanning\": {\n",
        "        \"tool\": \"pip-licenses\",\n",
        "        \"blocked_licenses\": [\"GPL-3.0\", \"AGPL-3.0\"],\n",
        "        \"fail_on_unknown\": True\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"dependency_approval\": {\n",
        "        \"check_against\": \"approved_packages.json\",\n",
        "        \"fail_on_unapproved\": True\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"sbom_generation\": {\n",
        "        \"required\": True,\n",
        "        \"format\": \"CycloneDX\",\n",
        "        \"upload_to\": \"sbom-repository\"\n",
        "    }\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "with open('security_gate_config.json', 'w') as f:\n",
        "    json.dump(security_gate_config, f, indent=2)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"✓ Created security_gate_config.json\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n[Security Gate Workflow]\")\n",
        "print(\"\"\"\n",
        "Pull Request Opened\n",
        "    ↓\n",
        "┌───────────────────────────────────┐\n",
        "│  SECURITY GATE PIPELINE           │\n",
        "├───────────────────────────────────┤\n",
        "│  1. Dependency Changed?           │\n",
        "│  2. Run pip-audit                 │\n",
        "│  3. Run Safety                    │\n",
        "│  4. Check licenses                │\n",
        "│  5. Verify approvals              │\n",
        "│  6. Generate SBOM                 │\n",
        "│  7. All checks passed → Allow PR  │\n",
        "└───────────────────────────────────┘\n",
        "\"\"\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n[Example: Build Failure]\")\n",
        "print(\"\"\"\n",
        "❌ Security Gate Failed\n",
        "\n",
        "Job: security-scan\n",
        "Failed at: Vulnerability Scanning\n",
        "\n",
        "Error: Critical vulnerabilities detected\n",
        "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n",
        "Package: numpy\n",
        "Version: 1.21.0\n",
        "Severity: CRITICAL (CVSS 9.8)\n",
        "CVE: GHSA-cfnr-3xfx-3fmv\n",
        "Description: Buffer overflow vulnerability\n",
        "\n",
        "Fix: Upgrade numpy to >=1.21.2\n",
        "\n",
        "Action Required:\n",
        "Update requirements.lock with patched version\n",
        "Run: pip-compile --upgrade-package numpy\n",
        "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n",
        "\n",
        "Build cannot proceed until vulnerabilities are resolved.\n",
        "\"\"\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n✅ Benefits:\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Prevents vulnerable code from reaching production\")\n",
        "print(\"  • No human error or oversight\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Consistent enforcement across all teams\")\n",
        "print(\"  • Clear feedback for developers\")"
      ]
